  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5922.09 Notice of Opportunity for Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5922.09 Notice of Opportunity for Hearing. Prior to taking any adjudicative action pursuant to RSA 541-A:31 and Saf-C 200, the division shall provide written notice to the licensee of the opportunity to request a hearing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
